msgstr "仅允许列表内的客户端"

msgid "Always use 40MHz channels even if the secondary channel overlaps. Using this option does not comply with IEEE 802.11n-2009!"
msgstr "即使副信道重叠也强制使用 40MHz 频宽。使用此选项不符合 IEEE 802.11n-2009 规范！"

