msgstr "已连接设备"

msgid "Association RSSI threshold (dBm)"
msgstr "关联信号阈值 (dBm)"

msgid "Association requests with a signal below this threshold are rejected (0 = off)."
msgstr "信号低于该阈值的关联请求将被拒绝（0 = 关闭）。"

msgid "At least one Access Point interface must be kept on each radio (MBSSID limit)."
msgstr "每个无线电必须至少保留一个接入点接口（MBSSID 限制）。"

