msgstr "<abbr title=\"基本服务集标识符\">BSSID</abbr>"

msgid "Choose the network(s) you want to attach to this wireless interface or fill out the <em>custom</em> field to define a new network."
msgstr "选择要绑定到此无线接口的网络，或在 <em>custom</em> 字段中填入名称以新建网络。"

msgid "Enables radio resource measurements for assisted roaming."
msgstr "启用无线资源测量以辅助漫游。"

msgid "Restart radio interface"
msgstr "重启无线电"

msgid "RSSI threshold for joining"
msgstr "加入网络的 RSSI 阈值"

msgid "RX Rate / TX Rate"
msgstr "接收速率 / 发送速率"

msgid "Scan failed"
msgstr "扫描失败"

msgid "Scan for networks…"
msgstr "扫描网络…"

msgid "Scan for upstream networks and set up a repeater link"
msgstr "扫描上级网络并建立中继链路"

msgid "Security mode"
msgstr "安全模式"

msgid "Select the upstream network to connect to. The AP-Client interface will bridge it into the selected network."
msgstr "选择要连接的上级网络。AP-Client 接口会将其桥接到所选网络。"

msgid "Short GI"
msgstr "Short GI"

msgid "Signal"
msgstr "信号"

msgid "SSID"
msgstr "SSID"

msgid "Stations with an average signal below this threshold are disconnected (0 = off)."
msgstr "平均信号低于该阈值的客户端将被断开（0 = 关闭）。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "The existing wireless configuration needs to be changed for LuCI to function properly."
msgstr "现有的无线配置需要调整后 LuCI 才能正常工作。"

msgid "This radio does not support AP-Client mode"
msgstr "该无线电不支持 AP-Client 模式"

msgid "Time interval for rekeying GTK"
msgstr "GTK 密钥更新间隔"

msgid "Transmit power in percent (0-100), 100 = driver default / maximum."
msgstr "发射功率百分比（0-100），100 = 驱动默认/最大值。"

msgid "Tx-Power"
msgstr "发射功率"

msgid "U-APSD power saving"
msgstr "U-APSD 省电模式"

msgid "Up to 129 entries are supported. Changes take effect after the wireless is reloaded."
msgstr "最多支持 129 条。更改在无线重新加载后生效。"

msgid "Uptime"
msgstr "在线时长"

msgid "Use the \"Repeater Scan\" button on the radio row to discover upstream networks. Only one client interface per radio is supported."
msgstr "请使用无线电行内的「中继扫描」按钮发现上级网络。每个无线电仅支持一个客户端接口。"

msgid "WMM Mode"
msgstr "WMM 模式"

msgid "Where Wi-Fi Multimedia (WMM) Mode QoS is disabled, clients may be limited to 802.11a/802.11g rates."
msgstr "禁用 WMM QoS 时，客户端速率可能被限制在 802.11a/802.11g。"

msgid "Hide <abbr title=\"Extended Service Set Identifier\">ESSID</abbr>"
msgstr "隐藏 <abbr title=\"扩展服务集标识符\">ESSID</abbr>"

msgid "Where the ESSID is hidden, clients may fail to roam and airtime efficiency may be significantly reduced."
msgstr "隐藏 ESSID 时客户端可能无法漫游，且空口时间效率会显著下降。"

msgid "Wireless Networks"
msgstr "无线网络"

msgid "Wireless Status"
msgstr "无线状态"

msgid "Wireless Security"
msgstr "无线安全"

msgid "Wireless configuration migration"
msgstr "无线配置迁移"

msgid "Wireless hardware NAT (HWNAT)"
msgstr "无线硬件 NAT (HWNAT)"

msgid "Wireless network is disabled"
msgstr "无线网络已停用"

msgid "Wireless network is enabled"
msgstr "无线网络已启用"

msgid "Wireless scan is running…"
msgstr "无线扫描进行中…"

msgid "Upon pressing \"Continue\", anonymous \"wifi-iface\" sections will be assigned with a name in the form <em>wifinet#</em> and the network will be restarted to apply the updated configuration."
msgstr "点击「继续」后，匿名「wifi-iface」节将被命名为 <em>wifinet#</em> 的形式，并重启网络以应用更新后的配置。"

